# Deny by default for the public bootstrap. Review new paths before allowing them.
# Private docs, release candidates, research data, model binaries, virtual
# environments, caches, wheels, mirrors, Terraform state/plans, credentials,
# execution outputs and signing keys stay outside this initial allowlist.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/.github/
/.github/*
!/.github/workflows/
/.github/workflows/*
!/.github/workflows/runner-smoke.yml
